; Short delay loop
;
; Counts BC down from 1000 to 0. The keyboard scanner calls it before each scan
; and uses the zero it leaves in BC to clear KeyFound.
; .
; Hardware: timing loop, about 1000 iterations of 4 instructions.
; .
; O:BC 0
@label=DelayShort
@isub=LD BC,1000
c$8B78 LD BC,$03E8   ;
*$8B7B DEC BC        ;
 $8B7C LD A,B        ;
 $8B7D OR C          ;
 $8B7E JR NZ,$8B7B   ;
 $8B80 RET           ;
